For the TI Beagle BoneBlack (BBB) board:

    cd <book_src>/ch4/dtdemo_platformdrv_via_dtb/bbb_dtb_stuff

 1. Setup the DTBO to get parsed at boot:
    - Compile the DTS (in ch4/dtdemo_platformdrv_via_dtb/bbb_dtb_stuff/) to the
      DTBO (DT overlay blob):
      make
    - Copy it into the appropriate location; on the BBB, for microSD, it's:
        /boot/dtbs/$(uname -r)/overlays/BBB-DTDEMO.dtbo
    - Insert this line into /boot/uEnv.txt to enable our DTBO to get loaded up on boot:
       dtb_overlay=/boot/dtbs/$(uname -r)/overlays/BBB-DTDEMO.dtbo
       (OR into any of uboot_overlay_addr1=..., uboot_overlay_addr2=..., ..., to
          uboot_overlay_addr7=... lines)
    - save, reboot the board
    - (You can boot from either the eMMC internal flash or the uSD card.. but then must
      accordingly supply the correct pathnames for the DTBO file of course; here
      we assume we're booting off the microSD card.)

 2. Use a terminal emulator (like minicom, etc); U-Boot prints should show that
    our DTBO (among perhaps several others) got loaded:
	...
	Checking for: /boot/uEnv.txt ...
	gpio: pin 55 (gpio 55) value is 1
	2669 bytes read in 3 ms (868.2 KiB/s)
	Loaded environment from /boot/uEnv.txt
	...
	loading /boot/vmlinuz-6.18.39-bone44 ...
	9138688 bytes read in 577 ms (15.1 MiB/s)
	debug: [enable_uboot_overlays=1] ...
	...
	uboot_overlays: [fdt_buffer=0x60000] ...
	uboot_overlays: loading /boot/dtbs/6.18.39-bone44/overlays/BB-ADC-00A0.dtbo ...
	645 bytes read in 8 ms (78.1 KiB/s)
	uboot_overlays: loading /boot/dtbs/6.18.39-bone44/overlays/BBB-DTDEMO.dtbo ...
	492 bytes read in 9 ms (52.7 KiB/s)
	...

 3. After getting a shell, verify that our new (pseudo) device's seen by the
    kernel:

    $ cat /proc/device-tree/my_device/compatible
    dtdemo,dtdemo_platdev

 4. Compile and run the driver; the probe method gets called, proving it worked!
    make && sudo insmod ./dtdemo_platdrv.ko
    dmesg
    ...
    [  185.450304] dtdemo_platdrv:dtdemo_platdrv_init(): inserted
    [  185.450591] dtdemo_platdev my_device: platform driver probe enter
    [  185.450612] dtdemo_platdev my_device: DT property 'aproperty' = my prop 1 (len=10)

Done!
